	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9362"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420" title="View the profile of Tiiden">Tiiden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 27<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forum.magecompendium.com/images/avatars/12385452393e812c24ac839.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Last of the Magicians!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=916.msg9362#msg9362"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=916.msg9362#msg9362">Re: Top 3 favorite Grinding Zones (all Expansions)</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> July 18, 2004, 06:01:42 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							1. Sebilis - spent so much time here, probibly the best dungeon ever created from a design standpoint, I think.&nbsp; This zone also really tought me how to solo well and preform in a group, I think I really learned what being a Magician was all about amoungst the frogs...<br />2. Lower Guk - had alot of fun (and incredible luck) here, spent alot of long nights farming it with friends.&nbsp; Been max Ally with live frogs for over 3 years now!<br />3. Oasis - origonally leveled up here pre-velious, and have leveled over 20 characters from 10-20+ in this zone.&nbsp; Love the ambiance, the atmosphere, everything about it.&nbsp; Really brings back that old EQ feel to stroll along the beach at sunset.&nbsp; Paludal caverns can go to HELL!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=370607" target="_blank">Magus Tiiden VandorGriffin</a><br />70 Magician, Officer of&nbsp; <a href="http://www.convictionguild.com/" target="_blank">&lt;Conviction&gt;</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
